0. 准备
从对外发布的包里面找到并安装
pip install ascendx_video-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl

从对外发布的包里面找到并安装 cann ops
source ./runtime/operate/AscendTurbo/set_env.bash
source ./runtime/operate/vendors/customize/bin/set_env.bash
source ./runtime/operate/vendors/customize_cloud/bin/set_env.bash
export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD_LIBRARY_PATH:./runtime/anaconda3/envs/PyTorch-2.5.1/lib/python3.11/site-packages/torch_npu/lib:./runtime/anaconda3/envs/PyTorch-2.5.1/lib/python3.11/site-packages/torch/lib/
export TORCH_DEVICE_BACKEND_AUTOLOAD=0

1. 下载ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper 节点，指定版本
git clone https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper.git
git reset --hard 37365817e82c3d6057fcb0a5d7f952f7376f096a

2. 将代码目录custom_nodes/ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper/comfyui_ascendx放在comfui原生代码custom_nodes/ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper目录下

3. 在comfyui_ascendx目录下执行patch_apply.sh

4. 修复多卡场景下视频保存bug
cd custom_nodes
git clone https://github.com/Kosinkadink/ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite.git
cd ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite/
git checkout 6e7f63867584bb1fb4944d36172e7f98436da9a1
pip install -r requirements.txt
将代码目录custom_nodes/ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite/video_save_adaptor.patch 放在comfui原生代码custom_nodes/ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite目录下
git apply video_save_adaptor.patch

5. 安装mindie(可选：支持lazer atten)
下载：https://www.hiascend.com/developer/download/community/result?module=ie+pt+cann&ie=2.1.RC1&pt=7.1.0&cann=8.2.RC1
安装：./Ascend-mindie_2.0.RC2_linux-aarch64.run --install
source /usr/local/Ascend/mindie/set_env.sh
source /usr/local/Ascend/nnal/atb/set_env.sh
source /usr/local/Ascend/nnal/asdsip/set_env.sh
source ./runtime/operate/AscendTurbo/set_env.bash
source ./runtime/operate/vendors/customize/bin/set_env.bash
source /usr/local/Ascend/mindie/set_env.sh
注意：mindie需要torch 2.1.0的基础镜像

6. 启动comfyui
单卡启动：
python main.py --port 8080 --listen 0.0.0.0

多卡启动：
将main_multi.py拷贝到comfyui目录下
执行 torchrun --nproc_per_node=2 --master_addr 127.0.0.1 --master_port 29505  main_multi.py --port 8080 --listen 0.0.0.0

7. 通过设置变量开启FSDP：export WAN_FSDP_ENABLE=true
8. 通过设置变量开启通算并行：export PHAA_ENABLE=true

*************************************
目前实现的功能：
1. w8a8线性层量化
2. sage attention
3. sp
4. laser attention(可选)
5. vae并行能力
6. FSDP
7. 通算并行


